    "created_at": "2022-07-14T01:25:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-14T01:25:23Z",
    "body": "In general sandboxing is not meant to prevent communication, especially at setup time, between the parent and the child. That seems like it'd require a different proposal, perhaps [fenced frames](https://github.com/WICG/fenced-frame).",
